# TDM-110: what `vercel deploy` uploads from the repo root (the project's Root Directory is apps/web).
# Allow-list: the web app, the workspace packages it imports, and the pnpm workspace files. Everything
# else (services, spikes, sim assets, .env and every other secret) never leaves this machine.
/*
!/apps
/apps/*
!/apps/web
!/packages
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/.npmrc
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vercel
